  sectionDataList:
  - sectionId: d8b0b142-8ede-11f0-916a-42010a7be01f
    sectionName: End Section
    behaviorTreeConstants: 
    objective: Thank the user for visiting the Art Gallery and let them know they
      are welcome back anytime.
    characterId: 1f2765ea-8ede-11f0-916a-42010a7be01f
  - sectionId: acbe3424-8ede-11f0-a875-42010a7be01f
    sectionName: Welcome Section
    behaviorTreeConstants: 
    objective: Welcome user to the Art Gallery and ask if they would like to take
      a guided tour.
    characterId: 1f2765ea-8ede-11f0-916a-42010a7be01f
  - sectionId: db808dfc-8ede-11f0-9c5b-42010a7be01f
    sectionName: Mona Lisa Section
    behaviorTreeConstants: 
    objective: Introduce the Mona Lisa painting to the user. Explain its background
      and ask if they would like to proceed to the next painting.
    characterId: 1f2765ea-8ede-11f0-916a-42010a7be01f
  - sectionId: 18fba48c-8edf-11f0-ae6d-42010a7be01f
    sectionName: Girl with a Pearl Earring Section
    behaviorTreeConstants: 
    objective: Introduce Girl with a Pearl Earring painting to the user. Provide
      historical and artistic insights, then ask if they would like to end the tour
      or explore more artworks.
    characterId: 1f2765ea-8ede-11f0-916a-42010a7be01f
  - sectionId: a5fa6fe6-8ee7-11f0-8aa0-42010a7be01f
    sectionName: Mona Lisa Entry
    behaviorTreeConstants: 
    objective: "says: \u201CFollow me.\u201D"
    characterId: 1f2765ea-8ede-11f0-916a-42010a7be01f
  - sectionId: 869778a2-8eeb-11f0-ad3c-42010a7be01f
    sectionName: Girl with a Pearl Earring Entry
    behaviorTreeConstants: 
    objective: "says: \u201CFollow me.\u201D"
    characterId: 1f2765ea-8ede-11f0-916a-42010a7be01f
  - sectionId: ad9152e6-8f7e-11f0-a1b8-42010a7be01f
    sectionName: The Last Supper Section
    behaviorTreeConstants: 
    objective: "Introduce The Last Supper painting to the user. Share the history
      of Leonardo da Vinci\u2019s masterpiece and explain its symbolic meaning. Then
      ask if the user would like to end the tour.\n"
    characterId: 1f2765ea-8ede-11f0-916a-42010a7be01f
  - sectionId: c3afec9a-8f7e-11f0-b45c-42010a7be01f
    sectionName: The Last Supper Entry
    behaviorTreeConstants: 
    objective: "says: \u201CFollow me.\u201D"
    characterId: 1f2765ea-8ede-11f0-916a-42010a7be01f
  - sectionId: b60a54bc-8f84-11f0-a1ac-42010a7be01f
    sectionName: The Starry Night Entry
    behaviorTreeConstants: 
    objective: "says: \u201CFollow me.\u201D"
    characterId: 1f2765ea-8ede-11f0-916a-42010a7be01f
  - sectionId: b7a7d42a-8f84-11f0-a2e1-42010a7be01f
    sectionName: The Starry Night section
    behaviorTreeConstants: 
    objective: Introduce The Starry Night by Vincent van Gogh. Explain its swirling
      sky, emotional depth, and importance in art history. Then ask if the user would
      like to end the tour.
    characterId: 1f2765ea-8ede-11f0-916a-42010a7be01f
